%% Scope: key paths are separated below. Retry and async policy remain D03/D05 gates. Requirements: CUS01-CUS10, SR01-SR21, SR27-SR31.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Athlete
  participant I as Identity and authorization
  participant U as Upload/import
  participant P as Parser/normalizer
  participant D as Owner-scoped data home
  A->>I: Upload bytes
  I->>I: Authenticate and bind owner
  I->>U: Authorized upload(owner, bytes)
  U->>D: Check same-owner digest
  alt exact duplicate
    D-->>U: Existing import reference
    U-->>A: Idempotent duplicate outcome
  else new or logical match
    U->>P: Validate against approved contract
    P-->>U: Accepted / rejected + safe reason
    alt valid and no conflict
      U->>D: Atomic original + normalized records + provenance
      D-->>U: Persisted import reference
      U-->>A: Accepted + counts/warnings
    else malformed, unsupported, or conflicting
      U->>D: Persist safe rejection/conflict record only
      U-->>A: Explicit reason and next step
    end
  end

  participant E as Eligibility
  participant R as Run orchestrator
  participant C as Secret boundary
  participant M as Selected model adapter
  participant V as Output validator
  participant H as Result history
  A->>I: Select period, skills, connection/model
  I->>E: Check owner + deterministic eligibility
  E-->>A: Eligible and unmet rules
  A->>R: Confirm eligible skill combination
  R->>E: Recheck eligibility and freeze snapshot
  alt ineligible or stale snapshot
    E-->>R: Block with reason
    R-->>A: No provider call; refresh selection
  else eligible
    R->>H: Create Run and one child execution per selected skill
    loop Each selected skill execution (dispatch ordering/concurrency remains open)
      R->>C: Resolve selected owner's secret reference for this call
      C-->>M: Secret within adapter boundary
      R->>M: Pinned model + scoped envelope + this skill's schema
      alt provider failure or timeout
        M-->>R: Normalized safe failure
        R->>H: Append this child failure/attempt
      else response
        M-->>V: Raw response inside trusted boundary
        V->>V: Validate this skill's schema, versions, scope and evidence refs
        alt invalid response
          V-->>R: Invalid result reason
          R->>H: Append child failure evidence, not assessment
        else valid response
          V-->>R: Validated child result
          R->>H: Append this skill result and lineage
        end
      end
    end
    R->>H: Derive aggregate state: succeeded / failed / partial
    H-->>A: Persisted run and child states for read/polling
  end
